Hi everyone,

I'm having trouble with some 2-factor glmer models that I'm trying to run, such that the model with one of the main effects removed is coming out identical to the full model. Some colleagues suggested that this might be due to the coding of my factors, specifically because I have a factor that has 3 levels, and that one needs to be treated differently, but I'm not sure how - or why - to do that.

Brief summary of my data:
